abstract: >-
  AtelierTeX is an open-source multilingual long-form LaTeX framework for
  ACGN, cross-media humanities, visual research and narrative scholarship.
  The project maintains ATX-ACGN-REF 0.4, an ACGN and cross-media citation
  profile built on GB/T 7714-2025 with media tags, locators and file-carrier
  mapping, together with rendered PDF specimens and publication-profile APIs.
